#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<putwchar> function is the wide-character equivalent of the "
#| "B<putchar> function. It writes the wide character I<wc> to B<stdout>.  If "
#| "I<ferror(stdout)> becomes true, it returns WEOF. If a wide character "
#| "conversion error occurs, it sets B<errno> to B<EILSEQ> and returns WEOF.  "
#| "Otherwise it returns I<wc>."
msgid ""
"The B<putwchar>()  function is the wide-character equivalent of the "
"B<putchar>(3)  function.  It writes the wide character I<wc> to I<stdout>.  "
"If I<ferror(stdout)> becomes true, it returns B<WEOF>.  If a wide character "
"conversion error occurs, it sets I<errno> to B<EILSEQ> and returns B<WEOF>.  "
"Otherwise, it returns I<wc>."
msgstr ""
"A função B<putwchar> é o equivalente para caracteres largos da função "
"B<putchar>. Ele escreve o caracter estendido I<wc> para B<stdout>. Se "
"I<ferror(stdout)> tornar-se verdadeira, ele retornará WEOF. Se um erro de "
"conversão de caracter largo ocorrer, ele atribui a B<errno> o valor "
"B<EILSEQ> e retorna WEOF. Caso contrário, retorna I<wc>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "For a nonlocking counterpart, see B<unlocked_stdio>(3)."
msgstr "Para uma contraparte não-bloqueante, veja B<unlocked_stdio>(3)."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
