#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<putwchar> function returns I<wc> if no error occurred, or WEOF to "
#| "indicate an error."
msgid ""
"The B<putwchar>()  function returns I<wc> if no error occurred, or B<WEOF> "
"to indicate an error."
msgstr ""
"A função B<putwchar> retorna I<wc> se nenhum erro ocorreu, ou WEOF para "
"indicar um erro."

